# scratch, retired data scripts, the motion libraries no page loads, and nine
# pictures nothing links to. Each was checked against every HTML, JS, CSS and
# JSON file in the repository before it was listed here. The tests, the
# notes and the audit trail stay in the repository and out of the build.
